+The family uses the exact equivalence in Section 6, Proposition 1 of
+arXiv:2403.00465: an unweighted schedule of heat d is a proper d-edge
+colouring.  Generation samples an affine factorisation first and emits the
+resulting regular bipartite polycule.  The answer is a compact symbolic
+periodic schedule, not an edge list discovered by solving the emitted graph.
+
+Generation is deterministic in ``(n, seed, params)``.  The module is standard
+library only, performs no file I/O, and prints nothing on import.
+"""
+
