The stabilized redesign now uses five disjoint affine scheduling components at the hard preset. That keeps the symbolic answer to 50 atomic values while increasing the mechanical edge-colouring/recovery workload; I’ve also corrected the paper citation to Section 5, Proposition 5.1 (with Lemma 2.1 for the DPS deadline form) and expanded the canonical-key test to each symmetry plus their composition. I’m waiting for the full 200,000-sample audit to finish before recording any numbers.
