+The intended shortcut observes that, within a panel,
+`sum(N(x)) = d*a*x + sum(B) (mod q)`. Two rows determine `a`, and one row then
+determines the offset set. Across five shipping panels this took 244 operations
+on average (246 on the measured shipping instance), below the no-tool cap but
+far shorter than either mechanical route. The paper's general NP-hardness and
+its exponential configuration graph in Section 4 are context only; they are
+not asserted as hardness evidence for this easy bipartite distribution.
 
