\section{Fractional Poly Scheduling}
\label{sec:fractional}

In this section, we generalize the notion of density from Pinwheel Scheduling for the Polyamorous Scheduling Problem. 
For that, we consider the dual of the linear program corresponding to a fractional variant of Poly Scheduling.

%
%
%
%
%
%
%
%
