-matching because a is nonzero; the d matchings partition all edges.  Combining
-the same-numbered matching from each disjoint panel gives a period-d schedule
-meeting every frequency-d deadline.  Generation therefore knows the symbolic
-schedule by inverse generation.  The verifier independently expands every
-rule, checks exact edge coverage and matching incidence, and checks the
