codex
At the actual shipping rung, the structural arm is 1/3 (one OpenAI solve, two failures). The placebo arm also has one solve so far. This variability is exactly why G9 is diagnostic now: the authoritative bare run still held 0/3, while isolated prompts reveal that some seeds/models can execute the route.
