All local gates pass. The shipping preset is `n=56, p=262139`; the bare oracle run hardened at 0/3 solved. The mechanical reference used 29,984,225 operations versus 112 for the compact moment route. Emission was also verified successfully.

One diagnostic remains incomplete: the placebo arm obtained 1/2 scored attempts, then four HTTP 403 quota errors. This is recorded honestly with `hinted_minus_placebo: null`; no API error was counted as a model failure.
